\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa60\f0\fs30\b Butterfly Atlas\b0\par
\sa240\fs17\cf1 Free and open-source software\cf0\par
\sa60\fs18\b Privacy\b0\par
\sa160 Butterfly Atlas makes no network connections and sends nothing anywhere. It runs entirely on your computer: its window talks only to the app itself on this computer, and your photos, their locations and your library never leave it.\par
\sa60\b Licence\b0\par
\sa160 Butterfly Atlas is free for anyone to use, copy, change and share under the Apache License 2.0. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The full licence is installed with the app as LICENSE in its folder.\par
\sa60\b Third-party software and data\b0\par
\sa240 The bundled taxonomy and place data and the third-party software keep their own licences, listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt. To read them now, choose \b Third-party notices...\b0  below; they are also installed in the app's folder.\par
